{
  "Name": "Okta - Admin & Configuration Changes - Okta Application Modified, Deactivated or Deleted",
  "Description": "Alert: Okta\nGroup: Admin & Configuration Changes\nMITRE ATT&CK: Impact / T1489\nSchedule: every 15 minutes over the previous 15 minutes (edit the scheduled search to change it)\nTuning: okta_user_allowlist / okta_ip_allowlist keys \"<login without domain>|Okta Application Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\" or \"<ip>|Okta Application Modified, Deactivated or Deleted\"\n\nDetects Okta application integrations being modified, deactivated or deleted (application.lifecycle.update / deactivate / delete). An attacker may disable or change an app to disrupt access or alter its sign-on configuration. Merges the separate modify, deactivate and delete rules.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_application_modified_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/?query=okta.yml",
  "Labels": [
    "okta",
    "detection",
    "admin-configuration-changes",
    "impact",
    "T1489"
  ],
  "Schedule": "12,27,42,57 * * * *",
  "Duration": -900,
  "DefaultDeploymentRules": {
    "Disabled": false,
    "RunImmediately": false
  },
  "ScheduledType": "search",
